# 0.1 (`RULE-POSITION-ENUMERATION`): `step` is RESERVED inside an index= range. REPORT ONLY,
# never rewritten: the tool cannot tell prose that reads like a step clause
# from an author who meant "every other element", which is the whole reason
# the spelling was reserved.
figdown 0.1 bitfield
bitfield tlv "TLV" numbering=msb0
field "Type" 8
field "Entry" 8 index="0..7 step 2"
